Zanarak fatally wounded Renia. She reached for Karak, asking him to give her all his remaining time so she could win.
Karak: No. My life is mine to choose.
Renia died with his name on her lips. Zanarak then offered Karak a final bargain: spend his life for a chance to challenge a god, or walk away.
Karak chose to walk away.
