Karak reunited with Vera among Gerano's survivors. Together they faced the uncertain life ahead.
Vera: How much time do you have left?
Karak: I don't know. But now, I get to choose how I spend it.
Vera took his hand. Karak smiled.
Karak: All the time in the world.
